<title>CANADA: Glamis Gold issues 4.5 million shares.</title>
<headline>Glamis Gold issues 4.5 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glamis Gold Ltd said on Thursday it will issue 4.5 million common shares for US$7.30 each.</p>
<p>Glamis said it had entered into a bought deal with a syndicate of underwriters led by Midland Walwyn Capital.</p>
<p>There is also a 48-hour option for the sale of an additional 500,000 shares on the same terms, Glamis said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company did not say what it would use the proceeds for.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
